        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 11432, Beverly Hills Egg Knob Mortise Entrance Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWhen we look at this mortise entryset, we think of opulence. It has a sleek, transitional design that is perfect on grand homes of all shapes and sizes. The Beverly Hills Mortise Handleset is built to stand out and will add an air of stately traditional beauty with just enough of a modern touch that it will look great on historic homes as well as new construction. Choose from several popular finishes. The Beverly Hills Egg Knob Mortise Entrance Set is available in a wide selection of functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-E08LE2_size.gif?v=1704442274\" width=\"600\" height=\"307\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Mortise Box Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also available for standard pre-drilled doors: <a href=\"/products/beverly-hills-egg-knob-entrance-set-omnia-d11432\">Omnia D11432</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Beverly Hills Mortise Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>Tough, non rusting materials used throughout. </li>\r\n<li>Mortise case is heavy wrought steel with zinc dichromate finish for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw, Solid Brass with Saw-proof Insert.</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed 3 Hour</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.13.2005, Grade 1 Lock</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Omnia 11432 Egg Knob Mortise Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Height: 10-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Height: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: Optional, 1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\" Thick Doors (<a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> if doors are thicker)</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>2-1⁄2” b.s.: with 3-7⁄8” minimum stile</li>\r\n<li>2-3⁄4” b.s.: with 4-1⁄2” minimum stile</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li>Front: Adjustable armored steel front, with 8\" x 1-1/4\" solid brass faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: Solid brass curved lip strike.4-7⁄8” x 1-1⁄4” x lip 1-1⁄4” to center.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/mortise-lockset-specs.pdf?v=1704262187\" target=\"new\"><b>Omnia Mortise Lockset Dimensions and Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Pair:</b> Stationary both sides of door. Fixed knobs, non-functioning. Used as door pulls or to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall / Closet):</b> The latch is operated by a knob from either side.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bathroom / Bedroom):</b> The latch operates by a knob from either side. Deadbolt is operated by a turnpiece inside and emergency key outside. Turning inside knob will retract both deadbolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Entry:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob from either side except when outside trim is locked by stop-button; then opens by key outside, by knob inside. Deadbolt activated by key outside and by turnpiece inside. </li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder Entry:</b>  Latchbolt operates by knob from either side except when outside trim is locked by stop-button; then opens by key outside, by knob inside. Deadbolt activated only by key from either side. </li>\r\n<li><b>Panic Proof Entry:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob from either side except when outside trim is locked by stop-button. Deadbolt activated by key outside and by turnpiece inside.  Turning inside knob will retract both deadbolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n<li><b>Storeroom:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob inside and by key outside. The outside knob is rigid. Auxiliary latchbolt deadlocks latchbolt.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LCN-2030-closer-size.gif?v=1704354558\" width=\"430\" height=\"140\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Beverly Hills Mortise Handleset, Omnia 11432",
                "description": "When we look at this mortise entryset, we think of opulence. It has a sleek, transitional design that is perfect on grand homes of all shapes and sizes. The Beverly Hills Mortise Handleset is built to stand out and will add an air of stately traditional beauty with just enough of a modern touch that it will look great on historic homes as well as new construction. Choose from several popular finishes. The Beverly Hills Egg Knob Mortise Entrance Set is available in a wide selection of functions.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Omnia 11432 Contemporary Mortise Locksets, Beverly Hills Mortise Handlesets, Omnia 11432, OMN-11432, omnia deadbolt, omnia commercial mortise deadbolts, contemporary knobs, contemporary door knobs, Omnia 434 knobs, egg knob handlesets, mortise entrance sets, Beverly Hills Egg Knob Mortise Entrance Sets,"
            },
